This game is really fun and really simple. We need more games like it. It contains quite a lot of legends and each legend has 2 weapons, and one weapon has a ton of attacks. You have light attacks, heavy attacks, air attacks and so on. A lotta gamemodes. There are also REALLY cool skins for legends and weapons! The problem is that they ae pretty expensive ;-;
If you're seeking anything in the reviews before installing, I have some tips. First try the ''Tournament'' singleplayer gamemode or the ''Training'' (also a singleplayer gamemode) to get used to the game. You'll discover some strategies, attacks and find out what kind of a legend you need (I for example am mastering legends with faster melee weapons). Try the other sinleplayer gamemodes (you will find 'em, you can play a Brawlhalla version of rugby :P) and move to MULTIPLAYER. After that, you will know what to do.
If I had to put an overall score it would be 8.5/10, I want more legends ;-;
Thank you for reading
